{"id":"d32735c9c47761b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Proper Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal — ZFC Ideal Proper Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal","58-df-zfc-ideal6-proper-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal — ZFC Ideal Proper Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-proper-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal — ZFC Ideal Proper Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\mathcal I,X\\in V\">\\(I,\\mathcal I,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6ProperIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6ProperIdeal}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S(I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S(I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6ProperIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6ProperIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Properness is the formal clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin I\">\\(X\\notin I\\)</span> for a set ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>; no unrelated generic <code>proper</code> predicate is used.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ideal6-proper-ideal</code> is merged here; it used the same proper-ideal closure conditions with reordered parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (set-ideal predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\mathcal I,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6ProperIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S(I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6ProperIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealProperIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)","display":true},{"tex":"X\\notin I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1244,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal-proper-ideal]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6e4f95381faac4f9"]}